<title>CHINA: SOCCER-CHINA BEAT TURKMENISTAN 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHINA BEAT TURKMENISTAN 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>China beat Turkmenistan 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in their World Cup Asian zone group eight</p>
<p>qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Li Jinyu 85</p>
<p>    Standings    P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> China	     4   4   0   0   9   2  12</p>
<p> Tajikistan	4   3   0   1  10   2   9</p>
<p> Turkmenistan    4   1   0   3   4   8   3</p>
<p> Vietnam	   4   0   0   4   2  13   0</p>
<p>Next matches: June 8 China v Tajikistan, Vietnam v</p>
<p>Turkmenistan.</p>
</text>
